# Read by ripgrep (and so by every agent's Grep), not by git. Generated output
# and dumps stay out of a search unless asked for by name:
#   rg --no-ignore -g revisions.json <pattern>
canary-local/emulator/dist/
canary-local/boards/*.glb
boards/vendor/
*.stl
*.3mf
*.glb
*.step.gz
*.icns
# generated from web_ui.h / csi_dashboard_html.h / companion_pwa.h
firmware/projects/canary-wap/arduino/canary_wap/web_assets_gz.h
# generated from the canary-display PlatformIO tree (setup.sh regen)
firmware/projects/canary-display/arduino/canary_display/
# catalogs the generators write (1.2 MB and 0.5 MB)
canary-local/devices/revisions.json
canary-local/devices/enclosures.json
# archives: a 1.8 MB audit dump and the 0.9 MB changelog
docs/audit/repo_todo_sweep_2026-09.md
CHANGELOG.md
Cargo.lock
package-lock.json
